complete 2258 Badlands Reagent Run [obj=3] | Rock Elemental Shards from the same Rock Elementals.
turnin 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 2418 Power Stones | Rigglefuzz at the camp in the middle of the Badlands.
accept 712 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 705 Pearl Diving
